@startuml ratai24-packages-abstract
title Ratai24 — supaprastinta paketų diagrama (sluoksniai)

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #333333

package "Ratai24.Presentation" as Pres <<Layer>> {
  class "CarsPage\n«Boundary»" as ExPage
  note bottom of ExPage
    MagicDraw: gali būti tuščias paketas arba 1–2 pavyzdinės klasės.
    Detaliai — package-diagram-ratai24-frontend.puml
  end note
}

package "Ratai24.WebApi" as Web <<Layer>> {
  class "CarController\n«Control»" as ExWeb
  note bottom of ExWeb
    Pavyzdys. Detaliai — package-diagram-ratai24-backend.puml
  end note
}

package "Ratai24.Application" as App <<Layer>> {
  class "PricingService\n«Control»" as ExApp
}

package "Ratai24.Persistence" as Per <<Layer>> {
  class "Car\n«Entity»" as ExPer
}

package "Ratai24.ExternalServices" as Ext <<Layer>> {
  class Cloudinary <<external>>
  class ResendEmail <<external>>
  class GoogleRecaptcha <<external>>
}

Pres ..> Web : <<use>>\nHTTPS / JSON
Web ..> App : <<use>>
App ..> Per : <<use>>
Web ..> Ext : <<use>>
App ..> Ext : <<use>>

note as NLegend
BCE ir HTTP riba
- Boundary — React puslapiai ir UI
- Controller (server) — Express maršrutai ir Controller klasės
- Entity — Prisma / DB objektai
- HTTP riba — tarp Presentation ir WebApi

ApiGateways / Axios: adapteris arba client-side control — paaiškinti vienodai.
end note

NLegend .. Pres

@enduml
